{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Retrieve object: if in sight, approach, pick up, and deliver. If heavy, call assistance. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectInSight    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Action ID = CallForAssistance    /> <Action ID = WaitForAssistance    /> <Action ID = DeliverObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />",
